  "iterationsWithSuccessfulJumpBeforeNextLayout": 3,
  "finding": "A same-document page-geometry relayout invokes Legacy.onLayoutUpdate/goToPosition(Duration.zero) while the application's goTo(280, 200ms) is active. The reanchor resets its AnimationController, cancels its TickerFuture and preserves the intermediate page. The original goTo Future remains pending. The app returns after its separate 3-second timeout, then the 45-second live-image observer fails because page 280 is not visible.",
  "responsibleComponent": "pdfrx 2.13.1 viewer animation/layout coordination; app timeout masks unresolved navigation but does not recover its destination",
  "sourceMechanism": [
    {
      "path": "pdfrx/lib/src/widgets/pdf_viewer.dart",
      "symbols": [
        "_goTo",
        "_updateLayout"
      ],
      "detail": "_goTo resets the shared animation controller and awaits animateTo without orCancel. _updateLayout invokes the size delegate on page geometry change."
    },
    {
      "path": "pdfrx/lib/src/widgets/sizing/pdf_viewer_size_delegate_legacy.dart",
      "symbols": [
        "onLayoutUpdate"
      ],
      "detail": "Maps the current/intermediate visible rectangle into the new layout, then invokes goToPosition with zero duration."
    },
    {
      "path": "lib/pdf_book/view/pdf_book_screen.dart",
      "symbols": [
        "_goToPageWithSpreadLock",
        "_jumpFromNavPane"
      ],
      "detail": "Awaits goTo through a 3-second timeout with an empty onTimeout; the subsequent diagnostic observer has a separate 45-second deadline."
    }
  ],
