  "limitations": [
    "The public-controller trace observes the real override calls and their Futures. Cancellation inside AnimationController is established by the locked source implementation, not an extra private cancellation counter.",
    "Diagnostic observers and stack capture add overhead; no timings are performance-comparable and three launches do not estimate the user failure rate.",
    "Iteration counts within a process are dependent. Each of the three processes eventually failed; three earlier iterations succeeded.",
    "The 3-second application await cap and subsequent 45-second final-image deadline are distinct. The elapsed phase includes both and is not a 48-second render measurement.",
    "Visible-render state verifies viewer image ownership/readiness, not physical GPU presentation."
  ]
